{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01521","headline":"琴曲歌辞 湘夫人 · 郎士元","name":"琴曲歌辞 湘夫人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"娥眉对湘水，遥哭苍梧间。\n万乘既已殁，孤舟谁忍还。\n至今楚山上，犹有泪痕斑。\n南有涔阳路，渺渺多新愁。\n昔神降回时，风波江上秋。\n彩云忽无处，碧水空安流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}